'''Giratina''' (Japanese: '''ギラティナ''' ''Giratina'') is a {{ct|Psychic}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Space-Time Smackdown}} expansion.

