==Trivia==
The illustration rare card features {{p|Giratina}}, {{p|Uxie}}, {{p|Mesprit}}, and {{p|Azelf}}.

===Origin===
*This card features {{p|Giratina}} in its {{form|Giratina|Origin Forme}}.
*{{a|Levitate}} is an [[Ability]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Giratina}} has while in its Origin Forme.
*'''Spooky Shot''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Legendary Treasures|Misdreavus|57}} and {{TCG ID|Legendary Treasures|Mismagius|58}}, both from the {{TCG|Legendary Treasures}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|X}}.

